theorem k215UnpairAt966CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt966State k215PNum966 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt966State k215PNum966 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt966Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt966Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt966Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt966ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt966Reach16))));
